head="""# Module D complete source reconciliation

All 453 lines of the unchanged source are partitioned below. Main declarations establish the principal theorem, actual algebraic seed/full-BFGS cycle, deterministic implementation, complete C2,1 scalar/objective construction and local failure. The six-module supplement establishes the actual 33 numerical quantities, exact source maximum-of-nine Euclidean bound and actual update denominators throughout the original root box. Compiler/type/axiom/strict-target logs are separate from this static source map.

The retained assertions are mapped to actual declarations or explicit remaining literal-export obligations. Four short source spans (non-strict interpreter equivalence, root-equation iff, convex-hull exclusion, and the exact affine weights) remain separately tracked; prose consequence reasoning is not counted as a completed Lean export. The five last-place nearest-rounding corrections preserve every original loose approximation within one displayed unit. Historical external-program execution correspondence remains provenance, not a premise or a claim of formal verification. No positive-measure basin or strong-Wolfe conclusion is added.

| Source lines | Claim | Status | Actual references | Review note |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
"""
body=[]
for r in rows:
 refsmd='; '.join(f'`{m}.{n}`' for m,n in r['references']) or '—'
 body.append(f"| {r['first']}–{r['last']} | {r['claim']} | {r['status']} | {refsmd} | {r['note']} |")
(P/'D_SOURCE_MAP.md').write_text(head+'\n'.join(body)+'\n')
